    "title": "Minnesota River Area Agency on Aging seeks public input on state plan for older adults - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lisa Kaye ,\n6 hours ago\nMANKATO, Minn. (KEYC) - The Minnesota River Area Agency on Aging (MNRAAA) is inviting older adults, caregivers, and community members to share input on the upcoming state plan on aging during an event on Nov. 18. The public session will be held at the Redwood Area Community Center in Redwood...\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources\n1",
